{"id":73941,"title":"159 | 开发环境搭建(lab01)（下）","content":"本次课程完成 Piggy Metrics 应用开发环境搭建的下半部分，核心任务是导入种子数据并配置项目源码。首先，针对演示账号无需登录即可使用的特性，需向 MongoDB 的 piggy_metrics_account_db 数据库注入初始数据。操作过程中，通过 Mongo Shell 执行 JavaScript 脚本，创建 accounts 集合并插入包含支出、收入及储蓄信息的 demo 文档；针对 Robo 3T 工具可能出现的执行错误，采用切换至原生 Shell 环境重新执行的方式成功解决。随后，从 GitHub 拉取改造版项目源码，该工程基于 Maven 聚合构建，涵盖 Eureka 注册中心、API 网关以及账户、通知、统计三个核心业务微服务模块。将源码导入 STS（Eclipse）集成开发环境后，可清晰对应系统架构中的各组件关系。至此，数据库实例、种子数据及微服务源码环境均已就绪，为后续微服务架构实验奠定了坚实基础。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":53028,"user_name":"学明","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1033677,"ip_address":"","ucode":"1A499A2557F74D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/c5/cd/7d3e4355.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1545572314,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":19367,"content":"谢谢提醒🌹","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1545654029,"ip_address":"","comment_id":53028,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"老师执行mongo 脚本的原因是，执行动作会针对选中的脚本执行。如果没有选中脚本，就会执行所有脚本命令。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":434019,"discussion_content":"谢谢提醒🌹","content_length":5,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1545654029,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}